WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.467 --> 00:00:10.953
Going on a bear hunt.

2
00:00:10.954 --> 00:00:13.493
I'm not afraid.

3
00:00:13.494 --> 00:00:15.117
It's a river.

4
00:00:15.118 --> 00:00:18.143
It's a wide river.

5
00:00:18.144 --> 00:00:20.048
We can't go over it.

6
00:00:20.049 --> 00:00:22.321
We can't go under it.

7
00:00:22.322 --> 00:00:26.982
Let's swim through it.

8
00:00:26.983 --> 00:00:28.955
Going on a bear hunt.

9
00:00:28.956 --> 00:00:30.638
I'm not afraid.

10
00:00:30.639 --> 00:00:32.047
It's a tree.

11
00:00:32.048 --> 00:00:36.221
It's a tall tree.

12
00:00:36.222 --> 00:00:38.205
We can't go over it.

13
00:00:38.206 --> 00:00:40.307
We can't go under it.

14
00:00:40.308 --> 00:00:45.436
Let's climb up it.

15
00:00:45.437 --> 00:00:49.711
Is there a bear over there? No!

16
00:00:49.712 --> 00:00:55.326
Is there a bear over there? No!

17
00:00:55.327 --> 00:00:57.240
Going on a bear hunt.

18
00:00:57.241 --> 00:00:58.795
I'm not afraid.

19
00:00:58.796 --> 00:01:04.106
It's grass. It's long grass.

20
00:01:04.107 --> 00:01:06.033
We can't go over it.

21
00:01:06.034 --> 00:01:08.045
We can't go under it.

22
00:01:08.046 --> 00:01:15.408
Let's walk through it.

23
00:01:15.409 --> 00:01:17.257
Going on a bear hunt.

24
00:01:17.258 --> 00:01:18.990
I'm not afraid.

25
00:01:18.991 --> 00:01:20.454
It's a cave.

26
00:01:20.455 --> 00:01:24.224
It's a dark cave.

27
00:01:24.225 --> 00:01:26.252
We can't go over it.

28
00:01:26.253 --> 00:01:28.337
We can't go under it.

29
00:01:28.338 --> 00:01:33.766
Let's creep inside.

30
00:01:33.767 --> 00:01:35.866
Quiet.

31
00:01:35.867 --> 00:01:39.191
Is there a bear in the cave?

32
00:01:39.192 --> 00:01:42.355
YES, there is.

33
00:01:42.356 --> 00:01:45.751
Run out of the cave.

34
00:01:45.752 --> 00:01:48.808
Walk through the grass.

35
00:01:48.809 --> 00:01:54.287
Climb up the tree and climb down the tree.

36
00:01:54.288 --> 00:01:57.464
Swim through the river.

37
00:01:57.465 --> 00:02:01.758
Go into the house and slam the door.

38
00:02:01.759 --> 00:02:04.962
Jump into bed and pull up the covers.

39
00:02:04.963 --> 00:02:11.220
"WE ARE NEVER GOING ON A BEAR HUNT AGAIN."
